flowchart TD
    C((Session coordinator<br/>the only owner of:<br/>session identity · state ·<br/>which surface is shown)):::c
    subgraph S[Surfaces - only one of these is on screen at a time]
      P[Compact panel]
      H[Training Hub]
      PR[Preparation]
      R[Recorder - full screen<br/>strength / endurance / recovery]
      F[Finish and Save]
      RV[Review]
    end
    E[Train emblem in the dock<br/>shows the coordinator's state]
    TABS[Home · Plan · Progress · Profile]
    ENG1[(Strength session store<br/>exists today)]
    ENG2[(Ride recorder<br/>exists today)]
    ENG3[(Recovery timer<br/>does not exist)]
    C --> P & H & PR & R & F & RV
    C --> E
    E -- tap --> C
    R -- minimise --> C
    C -- shows tabs, keeps session --> TABS
    C -. reads and commands, never duplicates .-> ENG1 & ENG2 & ENG3
    classDef c fill:#16181c,color:#fff,stroke:#16181c
